\newlabel{fig: stoichoimetric_matrix}{{2.5}{15}{A representation of the hypergraph from Figure \ref {fig: hypergraph} as \ref {out_incidence} an out-incidence matrix $\mathbf {S}^-$ and \ref {in_incidence} an in-incidence matrix $\mathbf {S}^+$. Only non-zero entries are shown. Since the hypergraph has $9$ vertices and $11$ hyperedges, the matrices have dimensions $9 \times 11$}{figure.caption.8}{}}
